  "title": "Louisiana Crawfish Étouffée",
  "description": "Crawfish étouffée is a Louisiana classic and comes together as quickly as you can cook a pot of rice. You can even substitute shrimp for crawfish tails.",
  "authors": [
    "Bonnie Lang Turnage-Mortgage O"
  ],
